StrongSort.Net
==============

A C# / .NET implementation of the StrongSORT multi-object tracking algorithm,
written from the published description of the algorithm. Since version 2.0.0 the
Kalman noise model, the Mahalanobis gate, the prediction cutoff and the camera
motion update are aligned with the bpbreid_strong_sort tracker in TrackLab.

TrackLab
  Upstream:  https://github.com/TrackingLaboratory/tracklab
  License:   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 bstandaert

Algorithm reference:
  StrongSORT: Make DeepSORT Great Again
  Yunhao Du, Zhicheng Zhao, Yang Song, Yanyun Zhao, Fei Su, Tao Gong, Hongying Meng
  arXiv:2202.13514 — https://arxiv.org/abs/2202.13514
  (builds on DeepSORT: Wojke, Bewley, Paulus, arXiv:1703.07402)

The default hyperparameters exposed on StrongSortOptions follow the SoccerNet
game-state tracking baseline; the values from the original StrongSORT paper are
documented inline in the source.

